Package: @@NAME@@
Version: @@DEBVERSION@@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Phillin-liu <phillin.liu@example.com>
Installed-Size: @@INSTALLED_SIZE@@
Section: games
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= @@GLIBC@@), libgl1, libglx0, libegl1, libgbm1, libdrm2
Recommends: fonts-noto-cjk
Suggests: ollama
Homepage: https://github.com/phillin-liu/ai-car-rase
Description: 3D two-player racing game driven by vision language models
 Each car is driven by a vision model (OpenAI, Anthropic, Ollama or any
 OpenAI-compatible endpoint): the game renders what the driver "sees" and
 the model answers with throttle / brake / steering.
 .
 This is the self-contained Nuitka build.  It carries its own Python
 interpreter, numpy, pygame, PyQt5, PyOpenGL and the Qt5 / SDL2 / X11
 libraries, so no python3-* package is required.  Only glibc and the
 OpenGL driver stack are taken from the system.
